    "description": {
      "value": "Simple but powerful, a battering ram is a full tree stripped of limbs with one end clad in iron, often shaped like a ram's head. Large handles are affixed to the sides so it can be hefted and carried by a crew.\n\n**Ram**\nActivate (3 Actions)\nRequirements: The other members of the crew have Readied to Stride on your order\nYou and the crew Stride, with a maximum distance equal to the slowest crew member's Speed, then make a melee Strike with the ram against a structure or an unattended, stationary object. The damage of this Strike is 5d8 + the highest Strength modifier among members of the crew."
